/*
 * Main menu state machine
 * -----------------------
 *
 * Entry point: CB2_InitMainMenu
 *
 * Note: States advance sequentially unless otherwise stated.
 *
 * CB2_InitMainMenu / CB2_ReinitMainMenu
 *  - Both of these states call InitMainMenu_main_menu, which does all the work.
 *  - In the Reinit case, the init code will check if the user came from
 *    the options screen. If they did, then the options menu item is
 *    pre-selected.
 *
 * Task_MainMenuCheckSaveFile_main_menu
 *  - Determines how many menu options to show based on whether
 *    the save file is Ok, empty, corrupted, etc.
 *  - If there was an error loading the save file, advance to
 *    Task_WaitForSaveFileErrorWindow_main_menu.
 *  - If there were no errors, advance to Task_MainMenuCheckBattery_main_menu.
 *  - Note that the check to enable Mystery Events would normally happen
 *    here, but this version of Emerald has them disabled.
 *
 * Task_WaitForSaveFileErrorWindow_main_menu
 *  - Wait for the text to finish printing and then for the A button
 *    to be pressed.
 *
 * Task_MainMenuCheckBattery_main_menu
 *  - If the battery is OK, advance to Task_DisplayMainMenu_main_menu.
 *  - If the battery is dry, advance to Task_WaitForBatteryDryErrorWindow_main_menu.
 *
 * Task_WaitForBatteryDryErrorWindow_main_menu
 *  - Wait for the text to finish printing and then for the A button
 *    to be pressed.
 *
 * Task_DisplayMainWindow
 *  - Display the buttons to the user. If the menu is in HAS_MYSTERY_EVENTS
 *    mode, there are too many buttons for one screen and a scrollbar is added,
 *    and the scrollbar task is spawned (Task_ScrollIndicatorArrowPairOnMainMenu).
 *
 * Task_HighlightSelectedMainMenuItem_main_menu
 *  - Update the UI to match the currently selected item.
 *
 * Task_HandleMainMenuInput_main_menu
 *  - If A is pressed, advance to Task_HandleMainMenuAPressed_main_menu.
 *  - If B is pressed, return to the title screen via CB2_InitTitleScreen.
 *  - If Up or Down is pressed, handle scrolling if there is a scroll bar, change
 *    the selection, then go back to Task_HighlightSelectedMainMenuItem_main_menu.
 *
 * Task_HandleMainMenuAPressed_main_menu
 *  - If the user selected New Game, advance to Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_Init_main_menu.
 *  - If the user selected Continue, advance to CB2_ContinueSavedGame.
 *  - If the user selected the Options menu, advance to CB2_InitOptionMenu.
 *  - If the user selected Mystery Gift, advance to CB2_InitMysteryGift. However,
 *    if the wireless adapter was removed, instead advance to
 *    Task_DisplayMainMenuInvalidActionError_main_menu.
 *  - Code to start a Mystery Event is present here, but is unreachable in this
 *    version.
 *
 * Task_HandleMainMenuBPressed_main_menu
 *  - Clean up the main menu and go back to CB2_InitTitleScreen.
 *
 * Task_DisplayMainMenuInvalidActionError_main_menu
 *  - Print one of three different error messages, wait for the text to stop
 *    printing, and then wait for A or B to be pressed.
 * - Then advance to Task_HandleMainMenuBPressed_main_menu.
 *
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_Init_main_menu
 *  - Load the sprites for the intro speech, start playing music
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WaitToShowBirch_main_menu
 *  - Spawn Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_FadeInTarget1OutTarget2_main_menu
 *  - Spawn Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_FadePlatformOut_main_menu
 *  - Both of these tasks destroy themselves when done.
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WaitForSpriteFadeInWelcome_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_ThisIsAPokemon_main_menu
 *  - When the text is done printing, spawns Task_NewGameBirchSpeechSub_InitPokeball
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_MainSpeech_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_AndYouAre_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_StartBirchLotadPlatformFade_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_StartBirchLotadPlatformFade_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_SlidePlatformAway_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_StartPlayerFadeIn_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WaitForPlayerFadeIn_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_BoyOrGirl_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WaitToShowGenderMenu_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_ChooseGender_main_menu
 *  - Animates by advancing to Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_SlideOutOldGenderSprite_main_menu
 *    whenever the player's selection changes.
 *  - Advances to Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WhatsYourName_main_menu when done.
 *
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_SlideOutOldGenderSprite_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_SlideInNewGenderSprite_main_menu
 *  - Returns back to Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_ChooseGender_main_menu.
 *
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WhatsYourName_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WaitForWhatsYourNameToPrint_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WaitPressBeforeNameChoice_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_StartNamingScreen_main_menu
 * C2_NamingScreen
 *  - Returns to CB2_NewGameBirchSpeech_ReturnFromNamingScreen_main_menu when done
 * CB2_NewGameBirchSpeech_ReturnFromNamingScreen_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_ReturnFromNamingScreenShowTextbox_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_SoItsPlayerName_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_CreateNameYesNo_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_ProcessNameYesNoMenu_main_menu
 *  - If confirmed, advance to Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_SlidePlatformAway2_main_menu.
 *  - Otherwise, return to Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_BoyOrGirl_main_menu.
 *
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_SlidePlatformAway2_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_ReshowBirchLotad_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WaitForSpriteFadeInAndTextPrinter_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_AreYouReady_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_ShrinkPlayer_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_WaitForPlayerShrink_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_FadePlayerToWhite_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeech_Cleanup_main_menu
 *  - Advances to CB2_NewGame.
 *
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeechSub_InitPokeball
 *  - Advances to Task_NewGameBirchSpeechSub_WaitForLotad_main_menu
 * Task_NewGameBirchSpeechSub_WaitForLotad_main_menu
 *  - Destroys itself when done.
 */

